## Unicode Collation Algorithm data

The generated files `crates/db-collation/src/mysql/table_0400.rs` and
`table_0900.rs` are derivative works of the Unicode Collation Algorithm (UCA)
weight tables.

- UCA 4.0.0: https://www.unicode.org/Public/UCA/4.0.0/allkeys-4.0.0.txt
- UCA 9.0.0: https://www.unicode.org/Public/UCA/9.0.0/allkeys.txt
- Copyright © Unicode, Inc. Licensed under the Unicode License v3
  (SPDX: `Unicode-3.0`, https://www.unicode.org/license.txt).

`harness/gen_weights.py` parses those files and derives MySQL's comparison
weights (primary weights only; see `harness/data/PROVENANCE.md`). No third-party
intermediate transcription is used.

